OL,3,GNEWSACouncil wants Bayeux Tapestry
OL,4,Apriority for residents
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council is calling for its residents
OL,7,Fto be offered priority booking to view
OL,8,Fthe Bayeux Tapestry at the British
OL,9,FMuseum.
OL,11,FCanterbury City Council in Kent said:
OL,12,F"Such an offer is available to the
OL,13,Fpeople of Hastings and Rother due to
OL,14,Fthe Bayeux Tapestry's links to these
OL,15,Fareas, but Canterbury district has not
OL,16,Fbeen included, despite it being widely
OL,17,Fconsidered that it was made here."
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
