OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil wants Bayeux Tapestry
OL,4,Apriority for residents
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil leader Alan Baldock added:
OL,7,F"Without Hastings, there would be no
OL,8,Ftapestry to celebrate and the very same
OL,9,Fis true of our great city. It's always
OL,10,Fthe workers, especially women, that are
OL,11,Fforgotten. In this case, it's
OL,12,FCanterbury's seamstresses."
OL,14,FThe British Museum has been contacted
OL,15,Ffor a comment.
